This directory is a modified copy, via the project's earlier spikes, of:

    e-Passport NFC Reader
    https://github.com/tananaev/passport-reader
    Copyright Anton Tananaev

Upstream states Apache License 2.0 in its README but ships no LICENSE file
(the GitHub API reports no licence for the repository). The Apache-2.0 text in
./LICENSE is supplied here on the basis of that stated licence, and matches the
licence of this repository. If upstream's licensing is ever clarified to be
otherwise, this directory must be revisited before any further distribution.

Modifications made for zkagent (README.md and docs/product/zkagent-prd.md
section 6.2 give the full list and reasons):
  - removed the Google product flavour, Firebase analytics/crashlytics and
    Play Ads/Review, and upstream's google-services.json
  - removed upstream's PRIVACY.md (a Play-listing policy for upstream's app)
  - removed the DG2 (facial image) read and the jnbis dependency
  - pinned compileSdk/targetSdk to 36
  - rewrote the app around the zkagent session, disclosure, masterlist
    verification and handoff logic (see README.md)

Distribution: this app is distributed as signed APKs on the project's GitHub
Releases (https://github.com/hamr0/zkagent/releases). Its applicationId is
com.zkagent.scanner. The Kotlin package and Gradle namespace deliberately
remain upstream's (com.tananaev.passportreader); that is cosmetic and does not
affect the applicationId.

This product includes software developed by third parties. They are resolved
from Maven at build time and are not vendored here; licences are as published
by each project:
